{
  "$comment": "Name-free archetypes: one per component kind, the field's shared vocabulary for it. Built from the WAI-ARIA Authoring Practices, HTML semantics and common UI vocabulary, never from one system. altLabels are names the field uses for the kind; falseFriends are names that often mean another kind. Part aliases and variant synonyms are the words systems use for the same thing.",
